            <text x="310" y="52" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Bricolage Grotesque, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="800" fill="#33302A">95% confidence interval</text>
            <text x="310" y="72" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Karla, sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="600" fill="#847B6B">estimate ± (critical value × standard error)</text>
